\b\i\fs24 Life events\b0\i0\fs18\par
A Life Event refers to any special non-recurring situation that may result in a relatively large change in your financial position. Such cases are the need to finance your or your children's education, an expensive vacation or other major changes such as buying a home. Such financial events do have an impact on your net worth and/or your ability to maintain the desired lifestyle.\par
We took into account all Life Events as stated in the enclosed statement.\par
