 \par
\b\fs24 Sequence of withdrawals\tab\b0\fs18\par
There will be years that you need to withdraw funds from your investments in order to meet your goals and\par
objectives. When such need arises the funds are withdrawn in the following sequence: \par
1.  From liquid Non-sheltered portfolios (such as bank deposits, GIS's, and Bonds) \par
2.  From Semi-sheltered portfolios such as Stocks and Mutual Funds \par
3.  From Sheltered (RRSP) portfolios. \par
